### Peticiones de la API TAR — ábrelo con la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code.
### Dale "Send Request" sobre cada bloque. Primero el login: guarda el token y
### las demás peticiones lo reutilizan solas.

@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Salud
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Login (admin seedeado) — guarda el token
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tarinternacional.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Usuario autenticado
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refrescar el access token (rota el refresh)
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### --- Propiedades (lectura pública) ---

### Listado con filtros + orden
GET {{base}}/properties?operation=venta&minPrice=1000000&sort=relevancia&limit=5

### Mapa por bbox (CDMX)
GET {{base}}/properties/map?bbox=-99.40,19.20,-99.00,19.60

### Detalle por slug (usa un slug real del listado)
GET {{base}}/properties/departamento-de-lujo-en-polanco-1

### --- Propiedades (admin) ---

### Crear borrador — guarda el id
# @name nueva
POST {{base}}/properties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Departamento de prueba (REST Client)",
  "propertyType": "departamento",
  "priceSale": 4500000,
  "currencySale": "MXN",
  "bedrooms": 2,
  "bathrooms": 2,
  "areaM2": 95,
  "estado": "Ciudad de México",
  "municipio": "Cuauhtémoc",
  "colonia": "Roma Norte"
}

###
@propId = {{nueva.response.body.data.id}}

### Fijar ubicación (geocoding daría estas coords) + premium
PATCH {{base}}/properties/{{propId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lat": 19.4145, "lng": -99.1700, "featured": "premium" }

### Publicar (genera slug, valida geo)
POST {{base}}/properties/{{propId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar estatus comercial
PATCH {{base}}/properties/{{propId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "apartado" }

### Subir imagen(es) — selecciona un archivo real en tu disco
POST {{base}}/properties/{{propId}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----tar

------tar
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="foto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./uploads/foto.jpg
------tar--

### Soft delete
DELETE {{base}}/properties/{{propId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }
